{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>ויצל אלהים.</b> Like the sense of וינצלו את מצרים (Exodus 12:36), and both are from the root of הצילני נא (Genesis 32:12), though this is somewhat distant. And what Jacob said to his wives is also true — that he saw this in a dream, for HaShem helped him to strengthen the flock and to breed even without the rods:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:31.763985884Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}